1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,683
Never force a stuck zipper.

2
00:00:02,044 --> 00:00:04,284
A pencil can free it in seconds.

3
00:00:04,467 --> 00:00:05,035
One.

4
00:00:05,396 --> 00:00:07,685
Back the slider up a little and lift

5
00:00:07,695 --> 00:00:09,865
the caught fabric out with tweezers.

6
00:00:10,067 --> 00:00:10,739
Two.

7
00:00:11,031 --> 00:00:14,144
Rub a pencil, soap or candle wax along

8
00:00:14,154 --> 00:00:16,394
the teeth and move the slider.

9
00:00:16,600 --> 00:00:17,296
Three.

10
00:00:17,750 --> 00:00:20,538
For a splitting zipper, press the slider
gently

11
00:00:20,548 --> 00:00:23,020
with pliers, then test it.

12
00:00:23,233 --> 00:00:24,869
Full guide on the channel.
